lambda=1.0, gamma=0.5: Delta+Deltam local slope sequence: -1.004 -> -1.001 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000
lambda=0.3, gamma=0.5: Delta+Deltam local slope sequence: -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000 -> -1.000
